<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cell Genesys rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cell Genesys rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Angus Macdonald initiated coverage of Cell Genesys Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares opened up 1/4 to six on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
</text>
